menu "Tab5 Keyboard (A164 dock)"

config MQJS_TAB5_KEYBOARD
    bool "M5Stack Tab5 keyboard dock support"
    depends on MQJS_TAB5_UI
    default y
    help
        Driver for the 70-key Tab5 keyboard dock (I2C 0x6D on the pogo
        connector, SDA=GPIO0 SCL=GPIO1 INT=GPIO50). Hot-pluggable: the
        driver probes for the dock and feeds key events into the same
        ui.onKey stream as the on-screen keyboard.

endmenu
